{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Calvin: Hey Dave! Nice to meet you! How's it going since we talked?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R4-locomo-conv-50/session_1-36574bb1f61f3ff154a48ddc", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T11:20:54.407577+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "36574bb1f61f3ff154a48ddc", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "36574bb1f61f3ff154a48ddc", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Dave: Hey Calvin! Nice to meet you too! Things have been going well since we last talked. I attended this awesome event recently. It was like a car lover's paradise! They had so many classic cars on show, I was in awe. I even had the opportunity to speak with some of the owners and hear their fascinating stories. It was super inspiring. What about you? Anything exciting happening in your life lately?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R4-locomo-conv-50/session_1-6b9e9bd640320b08e622d71d", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T11:20:58.510196+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "6b9e9bd640320b08e622d71d", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "6b9e9bd640320b08e622d71d", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Calvin: That event sounds great! Something really exciting happened to me - I just had a big life change! Here's my new mansion - pretty cool huh?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R4-locomo-conv-50/session_1-e08cff3dbd1588049e5eb1fd", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T11:21:02.610057+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "e08cff3dbd1588049e5eb1fd", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "e08cff3dbd1588049e5eb1fd", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Dave: Wow! Congrats on the big change! What inspired you to start this journey?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R4-locomo-conv-50/session_1-e4080db02dc89fc03b4f2df0", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T11:21:06.699752+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "e4080db02dc89fc03b4f2df0", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "e4080db02dc89fc03b4f2df0", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Calvin: I'm so excited to learn about Japanese culture and get a chance to expand."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R4-locomo-conv-50/session_1-354b2925dda70fe55a3cffc8", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T11:21:10.770472+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "354b2925dda70fe55a3cffc8", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "354b2925dda70fe55a3cffc8", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Dave: Wow, Calvin, learning about new cultures is awesome! Have you ever been to Japan?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R4-locomo-conv-50/session_1-5ca97d7644f07a552dbc5376", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T11:21:14.874188+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "5ca97d7644f07a552dbc5376", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "5ca97d7644f07a552dbc5376", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Calvin: Never been there before. Fascinated by the traditions and can't wait to get a taste of the culture."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R4-locomo-conv-50/session_1-9e03ed9c0d9379c33a3f1e68", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T11:21:18.971672+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "9e03ed9c0d9379c33a3f1e68", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "9e03ed9c0d9379c33a3f1e68", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Dave: Wow, Japan sounds amazing. Can't wait to hear all about it! When are you leaving?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R4-locomo-conv-50/session_1-0abb2e5bcecddf250a20b994", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T11:21:23.053465+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "0abb2e5bcecddf250a20b994", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "0abb2e5bcecddf250a20b994", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Calvin: I'm heading there next month. I'll be staying in such a nice place while I'm there."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R4-locomo-conv-50/session_1-451c869d73d6771a37364112", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T11:21:27.155128+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "451c869d73d6771a37364112", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "451c869d73d6771a37364112", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Dave: That looks cozy! Where'd you find a place to stay there?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R4-locomo-conv-50/session_1-2a53d845ebcba2d99f8779bb", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T11:21:31.256866+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "2a53d845ebcba2d99f8779bb", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "2a53d845ebcba2d99f8779bb", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Calvin: Wow, my agent found me this awesome place, so thankful!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R4-locomo-conv-50/session_1-79ae99016da29b943fc86563", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T11:21:35.318535+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "79ae99016da29b943fc86563", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "79ae99016da29b943fc86563", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Dave: Awesome! Having a place to stay is key. What are your plans for the trip?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R4-locomo-conv-50/session_1-2ecc0250670428f834973127", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T11:21:39.417784+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "2ecc0250670428f834973127", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "2ecc0250670428f834973127", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Calvin: I'm planning to explore the city, try out different local cuisines, and perhaps collaborate with musicians in the area."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R4-locomo-conv-50/session_1-5598b0c8cb6f8ffa6ae05846", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T11:21:43.510753+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "5598b0c8cb6f8ffa6ae05846", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "5598b0c8cb6f8ffa6ae05846", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Dave: Sounds great! Collaborating with local musicians would be an amazing experience. How long are you planning to stay in Japan?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R4-locomo-conv-50/session_1-9a7338090a45e5d40f0c5058", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T11:21:47.587890+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "9a7338090a45e5d40f0c5058", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "9a7338090a45e5d40f0c5058", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Calvin: I'm gonna be in Japan for a few months then off to Boston! I can't wait!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R4-locomo-conv-50/session_1-228fba93ff8c09a4428f1f58", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T11:21:51.684202+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "228fba93ff8c09a4428f1f58", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "228fba93ff8c09a4428f1f58", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Dave: That's great, can't wait for you to return from your trip. I've been spending lots of time at this beautiful park lately - so calming. Have you been there before?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R4-locomo-conv-50/session_1-0bd2de0ea6571af439f69bc3", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T11:21:55.779901+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "0bd2de0ea6571af439f69bc3", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "0bd2de0ea6571af439f69bc3", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Calvin: No, I've never been in that park. Looks like a chill spot. I'll definitely check it out when I'm back. Appreciate the tip!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R4-locomo-conv-50/session_1-6b6694e74182b53c2db4054c", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T11:21:59.842833+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "6b6694e74182b53c2db4054c", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "6b6694e74182b53c2db4054c", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Dave: Cool! Enjoy your trip! Let me know if you need any more recommendations. Have fun!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R4-locomo-conv-50/session_1-b4eaf0af63fea84650a9eb59", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T11:22:03.928902+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "b4eaf0af63fea84650a9eb59", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "b4eaf0af63fea84650a9eb59", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Calvin: Thanks, Dave! If I need any help, I'll be sure to let you know. Stay safe!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R4-locomo-conv-50/session_1-c54430aa66be8581616cba2e", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T11:22:08.019942+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "c54430aa66be8581616cba2e", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "c54430aa66be8581616cba2e", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
